{
  "summary": "The change makes TypeCollector report diagnostics only when their location is in the source compilation being analyzed, and makes location access null-safe for metadata-declared symbols by replacing DeclaringSyntaxReferences[0] indexing with FirstOrDefault and a dedicated GetPropertyIdentifierLocation helper. This addresses the CS8785 source-generator crash and AD0001 analyzer throw for closed generic value types from referenced assemblies, and prevents out-of-compilation diagnostic locations. The three new metadata-reference tests pass, the full suite passes with no regressions, but the tests.fail_without_fix check was not run, so the required evidence that the tests fail without the fix is missing.",
  "requirement_verdicts": [
    {
      "req": "REQ-2283-F1",
      "verdict": "met",
      "confidence_basis": "The three new metadata-reference tests pass on head and assert no generator diagnostics plus generation of the expected resolver; the build passes; the head code removes the [0] index on DeclaringSyntaxReferences that crashes for metadata-declared types, whereas base lines 985 and 1077 index [0] directly.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "requirement",
          "req": "REQ-2283-F1",
          "quote": "Building a project whose [MessagePackObject] type has a member of a closed generic value type defined in a referenced assembly must not crash the source generator (no CS8785) and must produce a generated resolver."
        },
        {
          "kind": "test",
          "name": "GenericsFormatterTests.ClosedGenericStruct_FromMetadataReference",
          "outcome": "passed"
        },
        {
          "kind": "test",
          "name": "GenericsFormatterTests.ClosedGenericRecordStruct_FromMetadataReference",
          "outcome": "passed"
        },
        {
          "kind": "test",
          "name": "GenericsFormatterTests.ClosedGenericStruct_FromMetadataReference_UnkeyedMember",
          "outcome": "passed"
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "id": "tests.targeted",
          "status": "pass"
        },
        {
          "kind": "check",
          "id": "build",
          "status": "pass"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "file": "src/MessagePack.SourceGenerator/CodeAnalysis/TypeCollector.cs",
          "line": 985,
          "rev": "head",
          "quote": "this.reportDiagnostic?.Invoke(Diagnostic.Create(MsgPack00xMessagePackAnalyzer.BothStringAndIntKeyAreNull, GetPropertyIdentifierLocation(item), formattedType.ToDisplayString(SymbolDisplayFormat.FullyQualifiedFormat), item.Name));"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "file": "src/MessagePack.SourceGenerator/CodeAnalysis/TypeCollector.cs",
          "line": 1077,
          "rev": "head",
          "quote": "Diagnostic.Create(MsgPack00xMessagePackAnalyzer.MemberNeedsKey, item.DeclaringSyntaxReferences.FirstOrDefault()?.GetSyntax().GetLocation(), formattedType.ToDisplayString(SymbolDisplayFormat.FullyQualifiedFormat), item.Name);"
        },
        {
          "kind": "code",
          "file": "src/MessagePack.SourceGenerator/CodeAnalysis/TypeCollector.cs",
          "line": 985,
          "rev": "base",
          "quote": "this.reportDiagnostic?.Invoke(Diagnostic.Create(MsgPack00xMessagePackAnalyzer.BothStringAndIntKeyAreNull, ((PropertyDeclarationSyntax)item.DeclaringSyntaxReferences[0].GetSyntax()).Identifier.GetLocation(), formattedType.ToDisplayString(SymbolDisplayFormat.FullyQualifiedFormat), item.Name));"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "req": "REQ-2283-F2",
      "verdict": "met",
      "confidence_basis": "The analyzer runs as part of the VerifyCS tests and the new metadata-reference tests pass with no diagnostics; they were written to capture the AD0001 analyzer throw, and all diagnostic reporting is funneled through the IsInSource guard.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "kind": "requirement",
          "req": "REQ-2283-F2",
          "quote": "The MsgPack00x analyzer must not throw (no AD0001) for the same input."
        },
        {
          "kind": "test",
          "name": "GenericsFormatterTests.ClosedGenericStruct_FromMetadataReference",
          "outcome": "passed"
